  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=70%><color=#9A6A2E><b>AUDIO 204</b></color></size>\n<b>Standing Buddha from Gandhara</b>\n<size=74%>1st\u20132nd century CE\n<i>Grey schist</i>\nVarious museum collections</size>\n<size=70%><line-height=110%>\nUnder the Kushan emperors, sculptors in Gandhara \u2013 today's north-western Pakistan and eastern Afghanistan \u2013 created some of the earliest images of the Buddha in human form. Wavy hair, deeply folded robes and calm faces show the influence of Greek and Roman art blended with Indian ideas.</size>"
